#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-55-01-000016.md:8
msgid "メッセージ"
msgstr "Message"

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-55-01-000016.md:10
msgid "コントローラーの上下限には有限値を入力し、最大値を最小値より 0.0001 以上大きくしてください。"
msgstr ""
"Enter finite controller limits with Maximum at least 0.0001 greater than "
"Minimum."

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-55-01-000016.md:12
msgid "原因"
msgstr "Why this happens"

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-55-01-000016.md:14
msgid "コントローラーの上下限が逆順、同値、非有限値、または差が 0.0001 未満です。"
msgstr ""
"The controller limits are reversed, equal, nonfinite, or less than 0.0001"
" apart."

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-55-01-000016.md:16
msgid "対処方法"
msgstr "How to resolve it"

#: ../../07_support/issues/FCS-55-01-000016.md:18
msgid ""
"最小値と最大値には有限の数値を入力し、最大値 − 最小値を 0.0001 "
"以上にしてください。例えば0と1は有効です。最大値を上げるか最小値を下げてください。一律の−1～1という制限はありません。"
msgstr ""
"Enter finite numbers for Minimum and Maximum, with Maximum − Minimum ≥ "
"0.0001. For example, 0 and 1 are accepted. Increase Maximum or decrease "
"Minimum; there is no fixed global −1 to 1 limit."

